program	errors/ref_forwarding_upgrade.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot forward `&` reference `r` as `&var`: a shared `&` reference cannot be upgraded to `&var`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot forward `&` reference `r` as `&var`: a shared `&` reference cannot be upgraded to `&var`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/ref_forwarding_upgrade.saw:14:10"
log	"     |"
log	" 14 |     bump(&var r)          // upgrade a `&` param to `&var` — rejected"
log	"     |          ^"
log	"   hint: take the parameter as `&var T` to forward it mutably, or forward it as `&r`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
